# Model weights are RELEASE ASSETS, not repository files.
#
# GitHub rejects any file over 100 MB on push, and gfpgan-v1.4-512-fp16.onnx is 170 MB — so a
# commit containing it does not merely bloat the history, it fails outright. Attaching them to a
# release instead keeps the repo small, gives every file a stable download URL, and lets a model be
# replaced without touching git history.
*.onnx
*.pth
*.bin

# Staged here purely so the five files are in one folder to drag into the GitHub release UI.
release-assets/
